.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-RETRACT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-retract \- Retract an entity\*(Aqs facts, optionally one predicate; history is kept
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu retract\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-predicate\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIentity\-IRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Retract an entity\*(Aqs facts, optionally one predicate; history is kept
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-predicate\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate IRI used to filter facts or edges
.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time timestamp for the operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIentity\-IRI\fR>

